# 30. IMPORTANT DESIGN RULE

Mission Potential Skill **tidak menggantikan Combat Skill**.

```text
Combat Skill
→ Digunakan untuk melakukan aksi combat.

Mission Potential Skill
→ Memberikan bonus terhadap performa Hero
  selama menjalankan mission.
```

Contoh:

```text
Combat Skill:
Power Strike
→ 120% ATK Damage

Mission Skill:
Battle Instinct
→ +5% Combat Performance
```

