# 32. CORE RULES

```text
RULE 01
Every summoned Hero may receive Mission Potential Skill.

RULE 02
Mission Potential Skill primarily affects
performance during Floor Missions.

RULE 03
Mission Potential Skill does not replace Combat Skill.

RULE 04
Class influences the Mission Skill Pool.

RULE 05
Race may influence the Mission Skill Pool.

RULE 06
Floor Environment can interact with Mission Skills.

RULE 07
Mission Skills can improve Combat, Survival,
Exploration, Resource, Team, Boss, and Recovery performance.

RULE 08
Skill rarity affects effect strength.

RULE 09
Duplicate skills between Heroes are allowed.

RULE 10
The same skill should not stack infinitely.

RULE 11
Mission Skill values must be configurable.

RULE 12
Higher Floors may require better Mission Potential
and stronger Hero specialization.

RULE 13
Mission Potential is one factor of mission success,
not the sole determinant.

RULE 14
Future Advanced/Unique Mission Skills should be
handled by separate systems.
```
